<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SMART IMPORT</view><view class="title">把通知，变成清楚的安排。</view><view class="subtitle">粘贴文字，逐项核对后加入待办与日程。</view><view wx:if="error" class="warning">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">日期基准</text><picker mode="date" value="{{baseDate}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{baseDate}} ▾</view></picker><view class="form-note">“周一”等以基准日期所在周计算，“明天”等以基准日期计算。请核对原始通知的发布日期。</view></view><textarea class="input" style="min-height:320rpx" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="20000" placeholder="粘贴群通知、每周安排或学期计划，建议一行一件事…"/><view class="actions"><button class="secondary small" bindtap="clipboard">粘贴剪贴板</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="image" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{ocrConfigured?'识别图片':'图片识别 · 待配置'}}</button><button class="subtle" bindtap="sample">填入示例</button></view><button class="primary" style="margin-top:26rpx;width:100%" bindtap="parse">识别工作事项</button><view class="form-note">当前使用日期与关键词规则解析。缺失或含糊的信息由你确认，不自动猜测。</view></view>
 <block wx:if="drafts.length"><view class="section">核对 {{drafts.length}} 项工作草稿</view><view class="form-note">取消圆圈可排除该项。缺失日期请补充后导入。</view><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="draftId" class="import-card"><view class="row"><view class="circle {{item.selected?'active':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.selected?'✓':''}}</view><input class="input min-width" value="{{item.title}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="title" bindinput="draft"/></view><view wx:if="item.needsReview" class="warning">原文存在待确认信息，请重点核对。</view><view class="field-row"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{item.date || baseDate}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="date" bindchange="draft"><view class="picker">{{item.date || '请确认日期'}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{item.time || '08:00'}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="time" bindchange="draft"><view class="picker">{{item.time || '全天'}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">分类</text><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="label" value="{{item.categoryIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="category"><view class="picker">{{categories[item.categoryIndex].label}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="switch-row"><view class="field-label">保存提醒偏好</view><switch color="#315b47" checked="{{item.remind}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="remind"/></view></view><button class="primary" style="width:100%" bindtap="accept">确认导入所选工作</button></block></view>
